01:04:14,117 --> 01:04:20,117
The Boys Next Door (released as No Apparent Motive in Australia) is a 1985 American neo-noir crime
drama film directed by Penelope Spheeris, from a screenplay by Glen Morgan and James Wong.

13
01:09:35,294 --> 01:09:41,294
It stars Maxwell Caulfield and Charlie Sheen as two sociopathic teenagers who leave their small town
home on the day of their high school graduation and embark on a crime and murder spree.

14
01:14:56,470 --> 01:15:02,470
The film was Spheeris' second narrative feature following Suburbia (1984),
and was released by New World Pictures on November 1, 1985.

15
01:20:17,647 --> 01:20:23,647
The film explores themes of gun, holiday, murder, arcade, serial killer.

16
01:25:38,823 --> 01:25:44,823
The tone is intense and dark and emotional.
